      "text": "Eric walks away from his cookies.",
      "sha256": "220ffc9f1225ebe8dd72eaa9299afac5f22fb3268d93c8b6c0c3b98e831deb1f"
    },
    {
      "clip_key": "carelessness_explanation_second",
      "text": "You’ll also use the same bars to show how careless each person was. A bigger bar means more careless.",
      "sha256": "ecd15a7e1c60983cd2b1853e44ef2f4b5f590aa713555bf5b5909b8a52a90af9"
    },
    {
      "clip_key": "carelessness_explanation_intro",
      "text": "In our game, you’ll be asked how careless each person was.",
      "sha256": "5c2edf4deab23cbbf759ae23ed2d2cd8cbcea2d9f703eaf56eb65b76a762f95f"
    },
    {
      "clip_key": "carelessness_explanation_large",
      "text": "If you think someone was very careless, make a lot of their bar blue.",
      "sha256": "344ba03c0a5412d5535c6c5d0e0991915f23e88393c3adfd8cecf905b94c359c"
    },
    {
      "clip_key": "carelessness_explanation_small",
      "text": "If you think they were a little careless, make a small part of their bar blue.",
      "sha256": "c3e22942f8aa204d4d11ce048e9a7158ab92ef79438bbad128175bc8130fecf2"
    },
    {
      "clip_key": "carelessness_explanation_zero",
      "text": "If you think they were not careless, click the little part at the beginning of their bar.",
      "sha256": "c0e05e6eef17d00ec4e1e9ae9fe2bc128f02a90d067c7430ac98e1053aa86c51"
    },
    {
